{
  "uid": "db-monitoring",
  "title": "MariaDB — Cluster, Replikasi & Error Log",
  "tags": [
    "database",
    "mariadb",
    "loki",
    "prometheus"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "LB Realtime",
      "url": "/d/lb-realtime",
      "icon": "external link",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tooltip": "Trafik masuk dan pembagian ke tiap Backend."
    },
    {
      "title": "Pengujian k6",
      "url": "/d/k6-lb",
      "icon": "external link",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tooltip": "Hasil Run k6 yang sedang dipilih."
    },
    {
      "title": "Run k6 (15 detik)",
      "url": "http://trigger.localhost/cgi-bin/trigger",
      "icon": "external link",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tooltip": "Mulai satu Run k6: 100 req/detik selama 15 detik."
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cara baca (atas ke bawah)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**1. Kartu** = kondisi cluster saat ini. Merah berarti butuh tindakan sekarang.\n**2. Tabel node** = jawaban atas \"siapa Primary, siapa Replika, replikasinya jalan?\" (sama dengan `make db-status`).\n**3. Replikasi & lag** = seberapa jauh Replika tertinggal; ini batas data yang bisa hilang (RPO).\n**4. Beban server** = query, koneksi, slow query, koneksi gagal.\n**5. CRUD aplikasi** = dampak nyata ke aplikasi: lambat, error, atau normal.\n**6. Alert + log** = penyebabnya.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1. Apakah cluster sehat sekarang?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Primary aktif",
      "description": "**Arti**: jumlah node yang hidup DAN menerima tulisan.\n**Normal**: 1 (hanya satu Primary).\n**Jika 0**: tidak ada tujuan tulis; semua CRUD gagal. Jalankan `make db-status`.\n**Jika > 1**: Split Brain — jangan menulis sebelum jelas siapa Primary.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "TIDAK ADA",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 2,
                "to": 9,
                "result": {
                  "text": "SPLIT BRAIN",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count((mysql_up{job=\"mariadb\"} == 1) and on(node) (mysql_global_variables_read_only{job=\"mariadb\"} == 0)) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Replika sehat",
      "description": "**Arti**: jumlah Replika yang hidup dan kedua thread replikasi berjalan.\n**Normal**: 2.\n**Jika 1 atau 0**: failover masih mungkin, tetapi kandidat pengganti berkurang. Cek tabel node dan panel replikasi.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count((mysql_up{job=\"mariadb\"} == 1) and on(node) (mysql_global_variables_read_only{job=\"mariadb\"} == 1) and on(node) (mysql_slave_status_slave_io_running{job=\"mariadb\"} == 1) and on(node) (mysql_slave_status_slave_sql_running{job=\"mariadb\"} == 1)) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Lag replika maksimum",
      "description": "**Arti**: selisih data terbaru Primary yang belum diterapkan Replika paling tertinggal.\n**Normal**: 0–1 detik.\n**Jika > 10 detik**: replika tertinggal; bila Primary mati tepat sekarang, data selama lag itu bisa hilang (RPO).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(mysql_slave_status_seconds_behind_master{job=\"mariadb\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error DB dari backend / menit",
      "description": "**Arti**: query CRUD yang gagal (konflik nama `ER_DUP_ENTRY` tidak dihitung karena itu kesalahan input, bukan gangguan).\n**Normal**: 0.\n**Jika > 0**: lihat panel Error per kode dan Log error.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.01
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(lb_db_errors_total{code!=\"ER_DUP_ENTRY\"}[2m])) * 60 or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Koneksi terpakai",
      "description": "**Arti**: persentase `max_connections` pada node yang paling penuh.\n**Konteks**: backend memakai pool 10 koneksi × 5 backend = 50 koneksi; batas MariaDB 151 per node.\n**Normal**: < 50%.\n**Jika > 80%**: alert `mariadb-connections-high` menyala; kurangi konkurensi atau naikkan batas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.8
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(mysql_global_status_threads_connected{job=\"mariadb\"} / on(node) mysql_global_variables_max_connections{job=\"mariadb\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cache InnoDB terpakai",
      "description": "**Arti**: persentase pembacaan InnoDB yang dilayani dari cache (buffer pool hit ratio), diambil dari node terendah.\n**Normal**: > 99%.\n**Jika < 90%**: data kerja tidak muat di cache; query akan lambat karena membaca disk.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.9
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min(1 - rate(mysql_global_status_innodb_buffer_pool_reads{job=\"mariadb\"}[5m]) / clamp_min(rate(mysql_global_status_innodb_buffer_pool_read_requests{job=\"mariadb\"}[5m]), 0.001)) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2. Siapa Primary, siapa Replika, dan replikasinya jalan?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Status per node",
      "description": "**Arti**: satu baris per node, sama seperti `make db-status`.\n**Koneksi**: HIDUP = exporter bisa login ke node itu.\n**Peran**: PRIMARY boleh ditulis; REPLIKA menolak tulisan.\n**Thread IO/SQL**: JALAN berarti replikasi aktif; Primary tidak punya baris ini (normal, tampil \"-\").\n**Lag**: batas data yang belum tersalin (RPO).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "noValue": "-"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Koneksi"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "MATI",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "HIDUP",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Peran"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "PRIMARY",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "REPLIKA",
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Thread IO"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "BERHENTI",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "JALAN",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Thread SQL"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "BERHENTI",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "JALAN",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Lag (detik)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": "",
          "reducers": [],
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "mysql_up{job=\"mariadb\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "mysql_global_variables_read_only{job=\"mariadb\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "mysql_slave_status_slave_io_running{job=\"mariadb\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "mysql_slave_status_slave_sql_running{job=\"mariadb\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "mysql_slave_status_seconds_behind_master{job=\"mariadb\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {
            "mode": "columns"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": {
            "byField": "node",
            "mode": "outer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "pattern": "^(node|mysql_.*)$"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "renameByName": {
              "node": "Node",
              "mysql_up": "Koneksi",
              "mysql_global_variables_read_only": "Peran",
              "mysql_slave_status_slave_io_running": "Thread IO",
              "mysql_slave_status_slave_sql_running": "Thread SQL",
              "mysql_slave_status_seconds_behind_master": "Lag (detik)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Node",
                "desc": false
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "3. Apakah replikasi mengejar Primary?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Thread replikasi (1 = berjalan)",
      "description": "**Arti**: dua thread replikasi tiap Replika. IO mengambil binlog dari Primary, SQL menerapkannya.\n**Normal**: semua garis di 1. Primary tidak punya garis ini, itu normal.\n**Jika salah satu 0**: replikasi berhenti; jalankan `make db-status` lalu rejoin node itu setelah diperbaiki.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
